ull,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Issue description\r\nIn the IMA extension, if the `AdsManager` is destroyed before the `ALL_ADS_COMPLETED` event is raised by IMA, the ad overlay view is leaked, which in turn can leak its activity.\r\n\r\nNote: This is a bug in dependency, but I'm filing this issue as a tracking bug for people who want to be updated on the status of the issue. [Internal: b/155041144]\r\n\r\n### Reproduction steps\r\nRun the demo app. Attach Android Studio profiler. Run an ad playback with the IMA extension. Return to the sample chooser. Take a heap dump and observe that the `PlayerActivity` has leaked.\r\n\r\n### Link to test content\r\nReproduces using IMA samples in the demo app.\r\n\r\n### A full bug report captured from the device\r\nn/a as already diagnosed.\r\n\r\n### Version of ExoPlayer being used\r\ndev-v2\r\n\r\n### Device(s) and version(s) of Android being used\r\nReproducible on API 29 emulator with Play Store.","closed_by":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre